OL,3,CUK sees 'really unusual' rise in
OL,4,Chummingbird hawk-moth sightings this
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FKnown for their distinctive grey furry
OL,8,Fbodies and bright orange wings,
OL,9,Fhummingbird hawk-moths are out in full
OL,10,Fforce this summer, with Britons taking
OL,11,Fto social media to share their snaps
OL,12,Fof the unusual creature.
OL,14,FThere were only eight recorded
OL,15,Fsightings of the hummingbird hawk-moth
OL,16,Fin the UK 2021, according to the
OL,17,FNational Trust.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
