OL,3,CUK sees 'really unusual' rise in
OL,4,Chummingbird hawk-moth sightings this
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,F"Its hovering flight is a
OL,8,Fdistinguishing feature; it flutters
OL,9,Fits wings so quickly that it can
OL,10,Fappear orange and makes an audible
OL,11,Fhum", say the Wildlife Trust.
OL,13,FThe quick-winged moth has a lot in
OL,14,Fcommon with the hummingbird, which it
OL,15,Fis named after, a species native to
OL,16,Fthe Americas.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
