OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785953905
OL,3,CUK sees 'really unusual' rise in
OL,4,Chummingbird hawk-moth sightings this
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FHowever, the hummingbird hawk-moth can
OL,8,Fbeat their wings up to 80 times a
OL,9,Fsecond, faster than their namesake `
OL,10,Fallowing them to fly up to 12 miles
OL,11,Fand hour.
OL,13,FWhy are we seeing so many this year?
OL,15,FThe day-flying moth can be spotted in
OL,16,Fthe UK in the summer, migrating from
OL,17,FSouthern Europe.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
