OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785953905
OL,3,CUK sees 'really unusual' rise in
OL,4,Chummingbird hawk-moth sightings this
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FIt is more common in some years, but
OL,8,Fthe Wildlife Trust's Strategic lead on
OL,9,FAgriculture Vicki Hird told ITV News
OL,10,Fthat the number of sightings this year
OL,11,Fis "really unusual".
OL,13,FExperts have attributed this year's
OL,14,Fhot weather and strong winds across
OL,15,FEurope.
OL,17,F"Windy conditions", she explained, can
OL,18,F"push" the moth "higher and over the
OL,19,Fcountry".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
