CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785953905
OL,3,CUK sees 'really unusual' rise in
OL,4,Chummingbird hawk-moth sightings this
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,F"It's possible that their food sources
OL,8,Fin Europe are being challenged by the
OL,9,Fdrought and that they are finding more
OL,10,F(food) over here", she added.
OL,12,FThe UK is also experiencing a once-in-
OL,13,Fa-decade "painted lady summer" as huge
OL,14,Fnumbers of the migratory butterflies
OL,15,Farrive and breed here,
OL,16,Fconservationists have said.
OL,18,FWildlife charity Butterfly
OL,19,FConservation have also attributed this
OL,20,Fincrease to warmer weather.
OL,26,@rD@ApmrD@Fpn
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
