OL,3,CUK sees 'really unusual' rise in
OL,4,Chummingbird hawk-moth sightings this
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FWill a hummingbird hawk-moth visit my
OL,8,Fgarden?
OL,10,FIf you want to spot a hummingbird hawk-
OL,11,Fmoth in your garden, Vicki advises
OL,12,Fgrowing flowering plants.
OL,14,F"These hummingbird hawk-moths
OL,15,Fabsolutely love flowering plants like
OL,16,Fvalerian and buddleia", she said.
OL,18,FThe species also requires bedstraw to
OL,19,Flay their eggs in, as this is what
OL,20,Ftheir caterpillars eat.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
